SUMMARY:ACTRIMS Forum 2027
DESCRIPTION:ACTRIMS Forum is the annual scientific and clinical meeting o
 f the Americas Committee for Treatment and Research in Multiple Sclerosi
 s. The 2027 Forum\, themed Charting the Path Forward\, is held in Phoeni
 x\, Arizona with an online option for virtual attendees.\n\nDeadlines\nA
 bstract submission opens: 2026-08-03\nRegular abstract submission deadli
 ne: 2026-11-06\nLate-breaking abstract submission opens: 2026-11-09\nLat
 e-breaking abstract submission deadline: 2026-12-04\nAbstract notificati
 on: 2027-01-08\nEarly registration deadline: 2027-02-10\nGroup registrat
 ion deadline: 2027-02-15\nIn-person registration deadline: 2027-03-01\nV
 irtual registration deadline: 2027-03-10\n\nhttps://www.forum.actrims.or
 g/
LOCATION:Phoenix\, Arizona\, Phoenix Convention Center
URL:https://www.forum.actrims.org/
